{"4214140": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "BioMech Vendetta", "steam_appid": 4214140, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🧬 Survive. Adapt. Evolve.</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Battle biomechanical monsters, evolve your soldier, and command a powerful companion as you fight to reclaim a planet reborn.</i></strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚔️ | <strong>Fight for Survival</strong> - Take on waves of biomech beasts, dinosaurs, and insects in intense third-person combat.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4214140/extras/28d49f9cfa8ea6ce369c74105c8034f7.poster.avif?t=1774527771\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4214140/extras/28d49f9cfa8ea6ce369c74105c8034f7.webm?t=1774527771\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4214140/extras/28d49f9cfa8ea6ce369c74105c8034f7.mp4?t=1774527771\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧠 | <strong>Customise Your Hero</strong> - Choose your soldier, master new weapons, and evolve through powerful skill trees.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4214140/extras/c95756387b3db2fb13f28ea8a80de035.poster.avif?t=1774527771\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4214140/extras/c95756387b3db2fb13f28ea8a80de035.webm?t=1774527771\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4214140/extras/c95756387b3db2fb13f28ea8a80de035.mp4?t=1774527771\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_pa